---
title: "setAcceptedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator calls setAcceptedCapital(acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot)
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_ended --> q_error_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_error_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_set_root: hasEnded == true
    q_set_root --> q_emit: acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = merkleRoot
    q_emit --> [*]: emit AcceptedCapitalSet(merkleRoot)

    note right of q_set_root
        INV-001: Accepted capital Merkle root enables excess capital withdrawal verification
        INV-002: Only settable after sale has ended
    end note
